CONTACT PUCKBOUND HOCKEY
Email Puckboundhockey@gmail.com for game help, bug reports or privacy questions. Include what happened, the screen you were on, your device and app version. Never send your private Team ID, sign-in credentials or a screenshot containing them. Please remove personal information from screenshots.
HOW TO PLAY
Drag on the left to skate. Tap SHOOT for a wrist shot, or hold to charge. PASS finds a teammate. On defense, CHECK hits and SWAP switches players. Open HOW TO PLAY on Home for full controls, rewards and pack odds.
YOUR TEAM & SAVES
Build your lineup with player cards and cosmetic gear. Ratings and stats are fixed. Progress saves automatically to your cloud team while connected. Open Team Save and check SAVED TO CLOUD before leaving. Screenshot your private Team ID and keep it private: anyone with it can access your team. There is no email or password recovery, and support cannot recover a lost Team ID. Music and SFX preferences stay on this device.
COINS, BUCKS & PACKS
Completed Quick Games earn 100 coins for a win or 50 coins for a loss, regardless of opponent or goals scored. No goal coin bonuses. Live play, Quick Skip and Quit Game simulation use the same once-only rewards. Team XP remains 100 XP for a win, 10 XP for a loss, plus 5 XP for each goal your team scores. Sell eligible cards or gear for coins, or exchange 1 Buck for 300 coins. Quick Game does not earn Bucks. Bucks checkout is disabled: listed bundles and planned prices cannot take payment or grant Bucks. Events, tournaments and friend matches are not available yet. Bronze packs cost 150 coins, Silver 1,000 coins, Gold 10 Bucks, Platinum 100 Bucks and Ultra 500 Bucks. Check each pack’s information panel for contents and random-draw odds before spending game currency.
AUDIO
SFX controls menu clicks and hockey effects. Music plays a quiet menu loop and stops throughout games, pause, Quick Skip and results. Mute each separately in Options. Audio downloads require a connection and may be cached. Menu Chill Music by etrock is released under CC0 1.0 (public-domain dedication).
LOGOUT & DELETION
Logout signs out this device but keeps your cloud team and a local gameplay backup. You need your private Team ID to return. Options → DELETE TEAM permanently deletes the active cloud team, invalidates its Team ID and removes its account credentials and gameplay saves from this device. Music and SFX preferences remain. Support cannot reverse deletion.
